{"Version":"0.5.5","Size":1947136,"Sha256":"7121E8A529815DF1D3CF4CD48E158E2AF1EF7D053000DDB46188030B065FDFF4","Downloads":["https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Utopian1025/myvault@0d0cd1beb5f0e3eae73b78f78c37aa95b127660f/cleartask/AIO-Workspace-Setup-0.5.5.bin","https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/Utopian1025/myvault@0d0cd1beb5f0e3eae73b78f78c37aa95b127660f/cleartask/AIO-Workspace-Setup-0.5.5.bin","https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/Utopian1025/myvault@0d0cd1beb5f0e3eae73b78f78c37aa95b127660f/cleartask/AIO-Workspace-Setup-0.5.5.bin","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Utopian1025/myvault/0d0cd1beb5f0e3eae73b78f78c37aa95b127660f/cleartask/AIO-Workspace-Setup-0.5.5.exe"],"Notes":"# AIO Workspace 0.5.5\r\n\r\n- 登录早期任务栏服务尚未就绪时，全局快捷键仍可唤出窗口。首次展示 Home 时跳过被遮挡的任务表刷新。\r\n\r\n\r\n- 横向导航底板和选中按钮分别调节透光率，缩短水滴弹簧动画。\r\n- 备忘录加入格式快捷键、正文右键纯文本粘贴、单篇 Markdown 导出、鼠标勾选和目录拖动排序。\r\n- 修正目录拖柄位置，调整输入光标绘制和窗口快照，按需创建备忘录编辑器。\r\n- 在全局配色与材质中可选择登录 Windows 后后台启动，使用已设置的全局快捷键唤出。\r\n\r\n\r\n","Signature":""}